OL,3,GNEWSABereaved mum 'disheartened' by
OL,4,Apetition response
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved mother campaigning for
OL,7,Ftougher sentences for drivers convicted
OL,8,Fof causing death while drunk says she
OL,9,Fis "disheartened" with a government
OL,10,Freply to her petition.
OL,12,FTracy Venison had lobbied for automatic
OL,13,Flifetime bans for drivers guilty of
OL,14,Fkilling people while under the
OL,15,Finfluence of drugs or alcohol.
OL,17,FHer campaign began after a drink-driver
OL,18,Fkilled her teenage son Aidan, who was
OL,19,Friding his motorcycle near Wisborough
OL,20,FGreen in West Sussex in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
