OL,3,GNEWSABereaved mum 'disheartened' by
OL,4,Apetition response
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,7,Fthe courts could already impose
OL,8,Flifetime bans where justified and were
OL,9,F"best placed to decide what is
OL,10,Fappropriate in each case".
